docs/AMAZON_META.md: why Amazon and Meta are missing (the terms pause only; probe run 7
crawled both whole boards cleanly), the terms and robots.txt quoted from the live pages
(amazon.jobs links amazon.com's Conditions of Use; metacareers.com's robots.txt carries a
written-permission notice), the routes ranked, the recommendation, the user's decisions and
two permission emails. data/alt/terms-2026-10-11.json records each page's URL, fetch time
and hash. The DOL workflow is a patch for the lead (read-only, manual, dol.gov only); the
script can print its summary as log chunks the freshness-probe decoder rebuilds.

